ame-rules/extracted/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "sha256": "21342cf965b4c64456776adea86f44d4ebf60815cebae4eb6c86187bf02fb580", "lines": [853, 867]}]}, "A": {"id": "Q101", "answer": "Shuffle all 20 standard tokens face down, then flip two face up beneath Landsraad Council; rest remain face down in bank. If Shaddam chosen, set aside both Sardaukar contracts before shuffle, shuffle remaining 18, reveal two and leave 16 face down plus two reserved. No choosing offers or presetting order is described; tokens are shuffled.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "CHOAM setup changes."}, "B": {"id": "Q101", "answer": "Shuffle the standard contract tokens face down before exposing the two face-up offers; put the rest face down in the bank. Players do not choose the offers or preset the order of the bank; the shuffle randomizes them.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "CHOAM Setup changes, line 194: shuffle tokens face down, then flip two face up and put rest face down in bank."}}

